{"name":"圆角的气质","description":"圆角的气质是指不同圆角大小在界面中带来的视觉感受和一致性规则 · 较小圆角常显得克制，较大圆角常显得柔和，可为按钮、卡片和输入框建立少量 圆角 Border Radius 档位。它们是设计经验，不是固定语义；相同角色应保持一致，具体数值仍要结合组件尺寸、品牌和场景测试。","quote":"全站的圆角统一一下，别有的方有的圆，看着乱。","agentPrompt":"请先按组件角色盘点圆角，再定义少量 small、medium、large 或等价 token。相同角色必须复用，胶囊只给明确的小型操作或标签；在真实卡片、输入框和按钮组合中比较整体气质。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-corner-feel\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>圆角的气质<span>Corner Feel</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">全站的圆角统一一下，别有的方有的圆，看着乱。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">圆角的气质是指不同圆角大小在界面中带来的视觉感受和一致性规则</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>较小圆角常显得克制，较大圆角常显得柔和，可为按钮、卡片和输入框建立少量<a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/border-radius?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"border-radius\" aria-label=\"圆角 Border Radius\">圆角 <b>Border Radius</b></a>档位。它们是设计经验，不是固定语义；相同角色应保持一致，具体数值仍要结合组件尺寸、品牌和场景测试。</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"corner-demo\">\n    <span class=\"corner-item\"><span class=\"corner-btn\" style=\"border-radius:0\">按钮</span>直角 · 边缘清楚</span>\n    <span class=\"corner-item\"><span class=\"corner-btn\" style=\"border-radius:6px\">按钮</span>较小圆角</span>\n    <span class=\"corner-item\"><span class=\"corner-btn\" style=\"border-radius:12px\">按钮</span>较大圆角</span>\n    <span class=\"corner-item\"><span class=\"corner-btn\" style=\"border-radius:999px\">按钮</span>胶囊轮廓</span>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请先按组件角色盘点圆角，再定义少量 small、medium、large 或等价 token。相同角色必须复用，胶囊只给明确的小型操作或标签；在真实卡片、输入框和按钮组合中比较整体气质。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">先按<b>组件角色建立圆角档位</b>：卡片、输入框、按钮可不同，但相同角色保持一致</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">较小圆角卡片</span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\" style=\"border-radius:6px\">保存</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">用<b>尺寸比例</b>检查圆角：小组件的大圆角会显得更强，胶囊通常适合高度较小的标签或按钮</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\" style=\"border-radius:999px\">立即体验</span><span style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand),#722ed1);color:#fff;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px\">林</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">在真实页面中<b>对照边框、阴影和密度</b>：圆角的感受来自组合，不由某个数值或行业决定</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">较大圆角卡片</span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\" style=\"border-radius:12px\">关注我</span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">同类元素的<b>圆角规则不一致</b>：相同角色看起来像来自不同系统</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:24px;height:18px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"width:24px;height:18px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:9px\"></span><span style=\"width:24px;height:18px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px\"></span><span style=\"width:24px;height:18px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:0\"></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">某个控件的<b>轮廓与页面系统差异过大</b>：应结合品牌、任务风险和其他控件一起评估</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">恒丰银行 · 大额转账</span><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\" style=\"border-radius:999px;background:#f7ba1e;border-color:#f7ba1e;color:#1d2129\">立即转账</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">按钮轮廓与页面其他控件差异过大，可能削弱整体一致性</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">所有层级<b>使用相同显著圆角</b>：卡片、输入框与按钮的角色可能不易区分</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:3px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);align-self:flex-start\">大圆角卡片</span><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"border-radius:20px;width:100%\">大圆角输入框</span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\" style=\"border-radius:20px;align-self:flex-start\">大圆角按钮</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>随意增加圆角数值</b>：没有对应组件角色或 token，后续难以维护</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px;padding:3px 8px\">值 A</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:13px;padding:3px 8px\">值 B</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:5px;padding:3px 8px\">值 C</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"corner-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"sharp\"><span class=\"corner-anat-s\" style=\"border-radius:0\"></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"subtle\"><span class=\"corner-anat-s\" style=\"border-radius:6px\"></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"friendly\"><span class=\"corner-anat-s\" style=\"border-radius:12px\"></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"pill\"><span class=\"corner-anat-s\" style=\"width:56px;border-radius:999px\"></span></span></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"sharp\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">直角</span><span class=\"pe\">Sharp</span></button><span class=\"pd\">半径为 0；可与边框、字重和间距共同形成更硬朗的轮廓</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"subtle\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">小圆角</span><span class=\"pe\">Subtle</span></button><span class=\"pd\">相对组件尺寸较小的半径，适合需要保留边缘感的界面元素</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"friendly\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">中圆角</span><span class=\"pe\">Medium</span></button><span class=\"pd\">半径占尺寸的比例更高；和组件比例、间距一起检查</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"pill\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">胶囊</span><span class=\"pe\">Pill</span></button><span class=\"pd\">半径至少接近高度的一半，形成两端圆弧的形状</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">直角<span>Sharp</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"corner-v\" style=\"border-radius:0\"></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">需要清楚边缘或与既有直角系统保持一致时</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">较小圆角<span>Subtle</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"corner-v\" style=\"border-radius:6px\"></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">需要保留边缘感，同时略微柔化轮廓时</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">较大圆角<span>Rounded</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"corner-v\" style=\"border-radius:12px\"></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">组件尺寸允许更明显圆弧，且与系统其他角色协调时</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">胶囊<span>Pill</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"corner-v\" style=\"width:64px;border-radius:999px\"></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">长条标签或按钮需要两端完整圆弧时</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">金融与工程工具</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:0;padding:12px 14px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1;color:var(--text)\">大额转账复核</b>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag gray\" style=\"border-radius:0\">待确认</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:6px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><span>收款方</span><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">恒晟贸易有限公司</span></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:6px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><span>金额</span><span style=\"color:var(--text);font-weight:600\">¥ 500,000.00</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;margin-top:10px\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"border-radius:0\">驳回</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"border-radius:0\">复核通过</button>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">企业 SaaS 界面</div><d